every 20 ticks do
if dirty_dust_chest has  >=3888*iron* or *copper* or *lead* or *nickel* or *osmium* or
*silver* or *uranium* or *tin_dust* or *zinc* or *aluminum* or *gold* or *platinum* then
input from dirty_dust_chest top side
output  36 *iron* or *copper* or *lead* or *nickel* or *osmium* or *silver* or *uranium* or *tin_dust* or *zinc* or *aluminum* or *gold* or *platinum* to each enrich left side slots 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
else if dirty_dust_chest has <=3888 *iron* or *copper* or *lead* or *nickel* or *osmium* or
*silver* or *uranium* or *tin_dust* or *zinc* or *aluminum* or *gold* or *platinum*
then
input **iron* or *copper* or *lead* or *nickel* or *osmium* or
*silver* or *uranium* or *tin_dust* or *zinc* or *aluminum* or *gold* or  *platinum* from dirty_dust_chest top side
output 4 *gold* to each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *iron* to each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *lead* to each enrich side slots 0
output 4 *nickel* to each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *osmium* to each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *silver* to  each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *uranium* to each enrich side slots 0
output  4 *tin_dust* to each enricht side slots 0
output  4 *copper* to each enrich side slots 0
output 4 *zinc* to each enrich side slots 0
output 4 *aluminum* to each enrich side slots 0
output 4 *platinum* to each enrich side slots 0
end
end
every 20 ticks do
input from each enrich side
output to dust_clean
end